	<string>ji lists your unresolved issues. ji ABC-123, j ABC-123, or j 123 opens that issue (bare numbers use JIRA_DEFAULT_PROJECT). ji some words searches summaries and text. Enter opens the issue, Cmd+Enter or Cmd+C copies its key. Results come from alfred-jira, which reads its Jira site from ~/.config/jira/env.</string>
